      "updated": 1794073596646,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Only two doors: port 80 for everyone (the web page) and\nport 22 for your laptop only. api and db have no door at\nall; only web talks to api, only api talks to db.\n\nThe notes live on the data disk, not on Linux's own disk.\nThe backup goes outside the VM, so losing the VM or its\ndisks doesn't lose the notes.",
      "originalText": "Only two doors: port 80 for everyone (the web page) and\nport 22 for your laptop only. api and db have no door at\nall; only web talks to api, only api talks to db.\n\nThe notes live on the data disk, not on Linux's own disk.\nThe backup goes outside the VM, so losing the VM or its\ndisks doesn't lose the notes.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "i5ocbdawtg7w",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
